WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.090
99th Seisho Festival

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:08.120
Seisho Grand Theater

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.080
Let's go! Together, we will grasp that star.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.580
It's okay.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.200
We'll all be together.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.040
Forever?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:30.870
Huh?

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.660
Yeah!

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.080
Karen-chan...

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.830
Karen-chan, good mor...

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:58.830
Futaba Isurugi

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.660
Get up!

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.660
You're on key duty today aren't you, Kaoruko?

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.120
Cut me some slack!

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:11.120
I'm still sore from yesterday's infamous "Seisho training"...

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.250
Well, my calves are killing me too, you know!

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.040
How come I had to get up early too?

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:18.750
Huh?

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:24.000
Hey, your back is getting stiff. Breathe in slowly.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.830
Just relax!

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.330
Karen-chan?

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.660
They got here even before me.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.410
'Morning, everyone!

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:35.200
Hey.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.120
Good morning to you.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.750
Good morning.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.540
Good morning.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.450
Good morning!

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.290
Tendo-san!

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.410
'Morning!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.410
Good morning.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.040
I WILL catch up to you, okay?

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:04.040
Fine.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.120
Karen-chan?

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:32.300
Revue Starlight

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:41.080
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:48.040
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:02:49.370 --> 00:03:02.410
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.660
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:12.370
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.580
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.450
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:22.080
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:28.540
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:32.620
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.160
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:39.750
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:43.580
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.200
Mou ichido
Once again

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.540
Karen Aijo, ready!

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:01.660
Hey! Don't land just using the tips of your toes!

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.700
Keep your hips and your joints in mind!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.660
Please let me try again!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.500
What's gotten into her?

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:15.410
She was here first thing in the morning to practice...

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.790
And she isn't napping during class.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:23.370
And she's been practicing by herself
after school until late.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.450
I've never seen Karen like this!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.370
My goodness...

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.330
That's like candy falling from the sky, don't you think?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.200
Ah! That would actually be quite nice...

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.000
Seems like you won't be able to let your guard down, eh?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:41.830
What?!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.080
With Karen?! This is KAREN, you know!

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:48.080
What the heck? Hey, wait up!

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:53.120
So, something happened... on that day.

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:55.930
Delivery

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:55.830
Thanks so much!

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.700
Hokkaido
Tsuyuzaki

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.700
Farm

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.200
Wow!

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:03.430
Yum
Potato Chips

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:03.450
Now this is a haul!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:12.320
Hokkaido
Tsuyuzaki Farm

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.580
Thank you, Mom and Dad!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.450
I sure hope Karen-chan and the others get to eat a
whole lot of these again this year!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:14.750
Huh?

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.500
Mahiru, are you doing well?

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:28.250
I'm sending you a lot of delicious food that
we harvested from our fields this year again.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.040
Please eat this with Karen-chan and the others.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:37.700
Oh, right. The other day I was organizing my dresser
when one of my treasures showed up.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:42.750
Dear Mahiru
Mahiru, ...

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:40.040
I'm sending that along, too.

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:42.750
Take care of yourself and do your best.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:44.620
Love, Grandma.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.870
Good Stuff!

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.750
Aplenty

00:05:49.750 --> 00:06:04.450
Wakkanai

00:05:49.750 --> 00:06:04.450
Aplenty

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:54.000
Sending you wonderful news from the local area:
"Good Stuff Aplenty TV!"

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.660
Today, we've come to Kitachian Junior High,

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:03.750
where one of the students from our city has passed
the exam for the prestigious Seisho Music Academy!

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.660
Let's introduce her!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:13.200
Asahikawa

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.370
This is Kitachian Junior High's third-year student,
Mahiru Tsuyuzaki!

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.000
H-hi!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.880
Tsuyuzaki Farm

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:18.000
Mahiru is the eldest daughter of the Tsuyuzaki Farm
family, and the eldest of six siblings!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:23.450
On the recommendation of her theater- and drama-loving
grandmother, she joined choir at age four.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:31.910
Sapporo

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.410
When she began baton twirling at age six,
her talent blossomed even more!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.500
Since then, she's been the recipient of many rewards.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.450
Abashiri

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:38.580
And now, she's done an impressive job of passing
the exam for Seisho Music Academy,

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:40.410
Seisho Music Academy

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.450
which has produced many stars!

00:06:40.450 --> 00:07:04.080
Sapporo

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:43.250
Mahiru-san, congratulations to you!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.700
Th-thank you.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:50.330
Applying for Seisho Music Academy was also
at the recommendation of your grandmother,

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.830
but how confident were you?

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:52.910
Confident?!

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.660
N-no, not at all!

00:06:56.290 --> 00:07:02.950
From April, you'll be taking a new step forward in Tokyo,
but exactly what type of star do you want to be?

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.370
"Star"?!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:07.450
Abashiri

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.120
Let's see...

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:19.160
"Being drawn by the stars and
coming to this tower was a mistake..."

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.250
"That light is cruel indeed."

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.500
"Everything you desire will be swept away!"

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.120
"What?!"

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:29.750
"Then, what will happen to my memories of you?"

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:35.040
"Will those memories... be lost forever?"

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.580
Grandma...

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:36.250
Seisho Music Academy sure is an amazing place.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:42.500
Everyone is talented, charming... and they shine.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.500
Compared to them, I-

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.870
"I am Flora!"

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.580
"And I am Claire."

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.500
"It's as if... we've always been together!"

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.500
"I'll see you here again next year..."

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.540
"On the night of the Star Festival!"

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:07.540
Okay, that's enough.

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.700
We'll do the second half in 15 minutes.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.200
I need a private place to work.
Can you help me find one?

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.790
Do you mind waiting a bit? I have to check-

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:28.790
Those two were perfectly in synch!

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:33.040
Aijo-san was better though, right?
Her tempo and timing were good too.

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:37.160
Yeah. I'd be fine if those two were the mains.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:44.000
Sure enough, Maya-chan and Claudine-chan
should be the leads...

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.580
Just like last time. That's what I think.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:53.540
I get where you're coming from,
but there's no need to have the same cast, right?

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:56.450
Even if we are doing "Starlight" for three years...

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.290
But-

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:58.370
Daiba-san.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:02.950
I do think we did a good job on "Starlight"
when we were first-years,

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.580
but that's considering we were still first-years.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.370
"Take care of the stage, and develop it further."

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.500
As the stage crew, that is our mission.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:17.700
If you want to learn to be stage crew as well,
you'll need to always want to try to push forward.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.040
I would like to see that, though...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.160
Aijo and Kagura as Flora and Claire.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.250
You can't, Kagura-san.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:41.000
At Karen-chan's side... That's where I...

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.410
Wait! Karen-chan!

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:47.750
Wait!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.200
Karen-chan!

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:10.790
I forgot this.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.750
Okay, that's enough.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.160
Karen-chan, here!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.080
Thanks, Mahiru-chan!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.200
Hey, Karen!

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.540
Let's go over that step we just did.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.870
Yeah, sounds good! Thanks!

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.790
Alright! Here we go!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:54.450
Huh.

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:58.250
Banana-han! For dinner tonight, le-

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.540
Kaoruko Hanayagi
Kaoru
Caramel
Chinese Herbs

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:04.620
Today was exhausting, too...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:07.950
When we get home, I'll cook up
some of Mahiru-chan's potatoes.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.620
Oh, can't wait!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.120
Potatoes!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:15.580
Potatoes! Potatoes! Potatoes!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.200
Okay! Let's give it another shot!

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:28.080
What? You're still gonna practice?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.790
Yup! Mahiru-chan, you can go ahead and leave first!

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.540
I forgot something.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.830
I can't... I can't take it anymore!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.700
Everything's all messed up!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:10.080
Ever since you got here,
Karen and I and our room have been just...

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.160
Give it back. Give Karen back!

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:18.200
You're good at singing and performing,
and your dancing is great, right?!

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.160
But I've got nothing! All I have is Karen-chan!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:24.540
So, don't take her...

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:28.200
Don't steal the only thing that shines for me!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:35.250
"Steal..." That's not a word you should use lightly.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:42.430
Audition
Day 4

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.200
Ah...

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:48.190
And it will be bestowed upon you,
the star which you seek.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.620
Oh...

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:57.290
An intense feeling of jealousy, burning brightly...

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.830
This has snatched away the naïve joy of a young girl.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.330
I understand.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:06.040
Please do not touch

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:10.580
Atop a stage brimming with stardust, in the flowers
of love that have so magnificently bloomed...

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:13.450
Student of the 99th class, Karen Aijo!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:16.830
We will all do Starlight!

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.790
I adore the shining stage, but...

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.790
I love it even more when you shine.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.080
In a duet that goes round and round,

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.660
I hope we can dance together, forever.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.120
Student of the 99th class, Mahiru Tsuyuzaki!

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.620
I was the one...

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.830
who was always by your side.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.290
M..Mahiru-chan?

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:50.750
And so, the fourth day of auditions,
the "Revue of Jealousy," will now commence.

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:01.620
REVUE
99th
SEISHO
FESTIVAL
Life of

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:01.620
the Stage

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:06.330
Ah, I'm so nervous my heart won't stop pounding!

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:11.410
It's okay, Mahiru-chan. I'll stay by your side.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.080
Karen-chan!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:16.790
Yes!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.910
Huh? Is that... me?!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.580
You'll stay with me? Forever?

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.870
Yes. I'll be by your side forever, Mahiru-chan!

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:34.000
Ah! Karen-chan!

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.660
Yay!

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:43.040
Mahiru-chan? Uh...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.450
This is what I can see.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:51.160
It's what I want... And what I don't have.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:57.790
Your light illuminated the darkness,
and that's what let me make it this far.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.160
You promised me on that day, right?

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:03.580
You said we'd be together forever.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.290
That's why I won't give you up.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:11.160
Kagura-san and the others...
I'll crush every single of them!

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:16.200
It's just you and me. WE will stand on that eternal stage!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:18.450
Revue of
Jealousy

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:18.450
Love's
Wicked Pitch

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.000
Huh?

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:27.870
What?!

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:37.330
Don't look away, don't keep your distance

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:42.160
Keep your gaze straight ahead, look only at me

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.080
MA
KA

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:46.700
Stay like that, forever

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:46.000
Roll, roll, roll, roll...

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.790
I won't forget what happened that day

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.040
Sugar cube
Ant nest
Cookie
Sleeping ant

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.250
Magic ball of love, the magic ball that vanishes

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.040
You remember it, right?

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:59.540
Hey, in this duet that goes round and round

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.330
It's okay, Karen-chan.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.790
Let's dance until we're tired

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.160
I won't hurt you!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.080
Oh no!

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.700
The day will break and it will be afternoon

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.620
Roll, roll, roll, roll, roll...

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:09.790
Hey, even if it's a swing and miss

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.580
Sugar cube
Ant nest
Cookie
Sleeping ant

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:12.870
Because the game will not end

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:17.540
The sky is our destiny

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.370
Karen-chan, wait!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.540
M..Mahiru-chan! S-stop this!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.250
Hey!
M..Mahiru-chan! S-stop this!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.040
You're wide open!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.040
Oh my, too bad!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.000
I've really gotta keep on my guard!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.700
Wait up!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.040
Roll, roll, roll, roll, roll...

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.000
Sugar cube
Ant nest
Cookie
Sleeping ant

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:44.910
Karen?!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.200
Huh?

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:49.660
In the midst of our Revue...

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.950
How could you look away?!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:54.370
Hikari-chan!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.410
Go back to how you were...

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.580
To the Karen-chan you were before
Kagura-san came here.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.830
Oversleep... and be late!

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.080
Just let me... be useful to you again!

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.000
Oh... Now I remember!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:19.500
The reason I became a Stage Girl was...

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:23.370
It was a promise with Hikari-chan, that I would...

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.660
do Starlight!

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:30.910
I'll go running, straightforward

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.120
That's why I can't lose.

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.870
I can't lose... to anyone!

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:35.620
Surely, right ahead, we will both become stars

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:40.410
The continuation of a dream we had once

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:43.370
I won't forget what happened that day

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:48.450
When I close my eyes I come alive, I can be reborn

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.100
REVUE
Mine and Karen-chan's
Beautiful Seisho Music Academy

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:53.370
Ah, a top this stage that goes round and round

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:56.450
We give our all and we clash

00:17:56.660 --> 00:18:00.290
This is our first time to do this, right?

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.370
Hey, who is it that changed you?

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.580
It's because I made a promise

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:11.120
With whom, and what kind of promise?

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.620
Do you not... need me anymore?!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:15.750
Hey, look only at me

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:14.160
Huh?!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:20.160
I studied singing and the baton... I even only came
to this school because my grandmother said to.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.870
See, there's a small light

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:22.790
That will disappear come midday

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.910
I have nothing!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.160
No confidence, no talent... No shine!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.830
You know, if you're not here then I

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.950
Will become nothing

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:30.900
REVUE
Mine and Karen-chan's...

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.950
Without your shine, Karen-chan, I can't do anything.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:33.660
Don't let the game end

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.160
So, please!

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:44.950
But, Mahiru-chan... You really are shining!

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:45.950
Huh?

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.250
I...

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.790
I love your pleasant singing voice.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:54.040
And I love that you dance like the sun!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.160
You're kind...

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.700
and en... enthu...

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.700
"Enthusiastic"?

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.500
Yeah, that!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.700
I love your enthusiastic performances, too!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:07.500
You think you have nothing? I say, non non!

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.000
You are shining!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.410
You came to this school because you wanted
to become something, right?!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.160
You're part of this audition because
you want to be the Star, right?!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.200
You have something too, right?!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:20.830
Hey, in this duet that goes round and round

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.790
You...

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:23.830
Let's dance until we're tired

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:23.620
have Starlight!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:27.700
The night will end and it will become midday

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:30.790
Hey, the sparkling sun

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.830
Shines light above the grass

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:38.450
Let's continue with the game

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:40.790
Okay, "Here I come"

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.000
Here I go!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.330
All right, "Be gentle"

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.330
I'll go easy on you.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:49.120
But there's no way I can lose, yup  ♥

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.500
MA

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.160
Game set!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:20:00.160
This concludes the fourth day of auditions.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:18.580
I lost.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:21.660
But...

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.450
Oh, Mahiru-chan!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.290
Your potatoes are ready!

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.830
Thanks for the food!

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:45.500
These potatoes made cooking SO worth it!
Eat all you like, okay?

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:49.000
Mahiru's potatoes are awesome this year too!

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:52.080
They're piping-hot and so delicious!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.450
You like potatoes, don't you?

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.790
Yes. This is potato.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.950
A full-bodied flavor hidden behind a simple façade...
Yummy! And how cute!

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:08.700
Starting April, you'll be taking a new step forward
in Tokyo, but what type of "Star" do you want to be?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.250
I forgot about that!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.700
Don't watch it!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:14.250
Kitachian Junior High
Abashiri

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.200
"Star"?

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.750
Um...

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:16.250
I want to...

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:22.790
I want to be a kind Star that
can make the people important to her smile!

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.620
See? Mahiru-chan, you're so cute and warm!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:33.330
And SUPER enthusiastic!

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:35.500
Yeah.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:37.120
You're shining.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:41.330
Coming to you from Kitachian Junior High,
see you all later!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:44.410
She's right. I really am shining.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.120
Even so...

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:55.910
Everyone shines so brightly that
I lost my confidence and became a coward.

00:21:56.700 --> 00:22:02.200
If I want to make the people important to me happy,
I can shine as much as I want.

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:06.370
Oh. It's delicious.

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:07.370
Sure is, right?!

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:13.160
I really do love this.

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:15.160
But...

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:19.200
I won't rely on anyone.

00:22:25.330 --> 00:22:26.370
I...

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:45.910
I've watched you for so long

00:22:45.910 --> 00:22:53.250
It seems you've set your loneliness aside

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:57.330
On this night, even the moon

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:00.870
Grins

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:03.830
Look this way

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:09.120
Oh, fly me to the star

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:32.040
I can't tell you how I feel

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:37.660
So many different lives

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:39.450
That I call to mind

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:43.580
And try to act out

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:47.500
Because it's your attention

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:50.250
That I want to attract

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:55.080
Oh, fly me to the star

00:24:00.070 --> 00:24:04.430
Next Time
Stage Left for Two

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.700
Revue Starlight.

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:04.450
I understand!
